OL,3,GNEWSATransplant boxer 'euphoric' after
OL,4,Afirst pro win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boxer who was told he would never
OL,7,Ffight again after developing a
OL,8,Flife-threatening blood disorder has
OL,9,Fdescribed feeling "euphoric" after
OL,10,Fwinning his first professional fight.
OL,12,FReuben Muston, from Reading, is
OL,13,Fbelieved to be the first boxer in the
OL,14,Fworld to be granted his professional
OL,15,Flicence after undergoing a bone marrow
OL,16,Ftransplant.
OL,18,FHe was diagnosed with aplastic anaemia,
OL,19,Fafter a nosebleed sustained in a
OL,20,Fnational final fight in 2022 would not
OL,21,Fstop for 24 hours.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
