OL,3,GNEWSATransplant boxer 'euphoric' after
OL,4,Afirst pro win
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe beat Jake Pollard on points at
OL,7,FHarrow Leisure Centre on Saturday and
OL,8,Fsaid the win "really meant something
OL,9,Fspecial".
